Subject: [PATCH] php-5.3.29-bug79296-2

Fix based on the following commit:

    From fe1fd6120db6d03c1a580a21b32e059fbc93d7aa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
    From: Remi Collet <remi@remirepo.net>
    Date: Thu, 19 Mar 2020 17:31:17 +0100
    Subject: [PATCH] Fix Bug #79296 ZipArchive::open fails on empty file

Signed-off-by: Dmitriy Popov <dpopov@cloudlinux.com>
---
 ext/zip/php_zip.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/ext/zip/php_zip.c b/ext/zip/php_zip.c
index 470b713..039667a 100644
--- a/ext/zip/php_zip.c
+++ b/ext/zip/php_zip.c
@@ -1547,7 +1547,7 @@ static ZIPARCHIVE_METHOD(open)
 
 	/* open for write without option to empty the archive */
 	if ((flags & (ZIP_TRUNCATE | ZIP_RDONLY)) == 0) {
-		zend_stat_t st;
+		struct stat st;
 
 		/* exists and is empty */
 		if (VCWD_STAT(resolved_path, &st) == 0 && st.st_size == 0) {
-- 
